```html
<code>
# @@@ total balance of all "frm" accounts is not less than "amnt"

total_balance = sum([acnt.money for acnt in frm.accounts])
assert total_balance >= amnt, "Total balance of all accounts is less than the amount to be transferred."
</code>
```
This `assert` statement checks if the total balance of all "frm" accounts is not less than "amnt". If the total balance is less, it raises an AssertionError with the specified message.
